  "usage_policy": [
    "For ordinary cross-source cases, use the common 2024-2025 observation window.",
    "Require both the economic observation/event date and the artifact availability date to be no later than 2025-12-31 for strict point-in-time cases.",
    "Treat BEA MNE 2023, EPA GHGRP 2023, SCF 2022, and FHFA UAD 2022 as lagged structural evidence, not same-year 2024-2025 measurements.",
    "Treat Census geography and current FFIEC NIC structure as reference bridges, not economic observations or frozen 2025 ownership state.",
    "For strict cutoff cases, exclude post-cutoff retrospective artifacts including 2025 annual QCEW/trade totals, 2025Q4 Y-9C, and current revised NOAA/NIC snapshots.",
    "Do not join entity-level tables on names alone; use stable identifiers or an explicit reviewed crosswalk.",
    "Aggregate daily, monthly, quarterly, and annual sources to a declared common frequency before comparing them."
  ]
